docs/NOTES.md

# --- Internal review panel output --------------------------------------------
review/

# --- Raw EFLM Biological Variation Database content --------------------------
# The EFLM licence forbids redistributing the database content or storing it in
# any other website or electronic retrieval system. Raw responses, the manual
# top-up file and every pipeline artefact that carries CV_I / CV_G columns in
# explicit form are therefore excluded from this repository.
data/raw/*.json
data/raw/topup_meta.csv
out/bv_meta.csv
out/sigma_specs.csv
out/sigma_requirements.csv
out/table1_analytes_desirable.csv
out/worked_example.csv
out/article_tables.md

